We collect minimal information to ensure the App functions properly and to improve your user experience:

· Usage Data: We may collect information on how the App is accessed and used (e.g., the movies you click on, the time and date of your visit, and the time spent on specific pages).
· Device Information: We collect non-personally identifiable data such as your device type, operating system version, unique device identifiers (e.g., Advertising ID), and IP address to diagnose problems and serve content appropriately.
· Cookies and Tracking: We and our third-party service providers may use cookies or similar tracking technologies to track activity and hold certain information for analytics.

We do NOT collect: Your real name, physical address, email address, or financial information unless you voluntarily provide it to us via a support request.

