· Access – Request a copy of the data we hold about you.
· Rectification – Request correction of inaccurate data.
· Deletion – Request we erase your personal data.
· Opt-out – Opt-out of targeted advertising via your device settings (typically found in "Settings > Privacy > Advertising" on mobile devices).

To exercise these rights, please contact us using the email below.

