9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. We will update the "Effective Date" at the top of this policy accordingly. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.
